            <ArticleTitle>[Ecchymosis during montelukast therapy: about one case].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>517-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2515/therapie/2014058</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A young girl aged 13-years-old treated with montelukast, fluticasone/salmeterol, desloratadine, fluticasone furoate and salbutamol has presented numerous spontaneous bruises after that treatment with montelukast was substituted by the generic form. Stopping montelukast allow a significant improvement in bruises.</AbstractText>
